    "%lld translations use placeholders that do not match the source text (first: “%@” in %@). When the app fills them in it can show the wrong value or crash." : {
      "comment" : "Warning on a String Catalog card. Placeholders are format codes such as %@ or %lld; the arguments are a count, a key and a language name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
