    "A %@ has no name; Avro requires every %@ to be named." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period. The argument is an Avro keyword: record, error, enum or fixed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
