    "App Transport Security is switched off (NSAllowsArbitraryLoads): the app may connect over plain HTTP, where others on the network can read and change what it sends and receives." : {
      "comment" : "Warning on an Info.plist card. NSAllowsArbitraryLoads is a key name and stays as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Transport Security ist ausgeschaltet (NSAllowsArbitraryLoads): Die App darf sich über unverschlüsseltes HTTP verbinden, wo andere im Netzwerk mitlesen und ändern können, was sie sendet und empfängt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Transport Security est désactivé (NSAllowsArbitraryLoads) : l’app peut se connecter en HTTP non chiffré, où d’autres personnes sur le réseau peuvent lire et modifier ce qu’elle envoie et reçoit."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Transport Securityがオフになっています（NSAllowsArbitraryLoads）。アプリは暗号化されていないHTTPで接続でき、ネットワーク上のほかの人が送受信内容を読み取ったり変更したりできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Transport Security가 꺼져 있습니다(NSAllowsArbitraryLoads). 앱이 암호화되지 않은 HTTP로 연결할 수 있어, 네트워크의 다른 사람이 주고받는 내용을 읽거나 바꿀 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
