    "lets DYLD_ environment variables inject code into the app when it starts" : {
      "comment" : "Why a hardened-runtime entitlement matters; follows “Hardened-runtime exception (key):”. DYLD_ stays as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "erlaubt DYLD_-Umgebungsvariablen, beim Start Code in die App einzuschleusen"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "permet aux variables d’environnement DYLD_ d’injecter du code dans l’app à son lancement"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動時にDYLD_環境変数でアプリにコードを注入できるようになります"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱이 시작될 때 DYLD_ 환경 변수로 코드를 주입할 수 있음"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets DYLD_ variables change which code the app loads at launch." : {
      "comment" : "What an entitlement lets an app do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
