    },
    "Mounts the Docker socket: anything in the container can control Docker, and through it the host." : {
      "comment" : "Infra card warning on a Compose service that mounts docker.sock.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bindet den Docker-Socket ein: Alles im Container kann Docker steuern und darüber den Host."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monte le socket Docker : tout ce qui tourne dans le conteneur peut contrôler Docker, et par lui l’hôte."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dockerソケットをマウントしています。コンテナ内のあらゆるものがDockerを、さらにそれを通じてホストを制御できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker 소켓을 마운트합니다. 컨테이너 안의 무엇이든 Docker를, 나아가 호스트를 제어할 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mounts the node's container runtime socket (%@), which controls every container on the node." : {
