            "value" : "보안"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security scheme %@ is HTTP Basic: the password goes with every request, so it is only safe over HTTPS." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period. The argument is the scheme's name in the file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Sicherheitsschema %@ ist HTTP Basic: Das Passwort wird mit jeder Anfrage gesendet und ist daher nur über HTTPS sicher."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le schéma de sécurité %@ est HTTP Basic : le mot de passe accompagne chaque requête, ce qui n’est sûr qu’en HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "セキュリティスキーム%@はHTTP Basicです。パスワードがすべてのリクエストとともに送られるため、HTTPS経由でのみ安全です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "보안 스킴 %@은(는) HTTP Basic입니다. 모든 요청에 암호가 함께 전송되므로 HTTPS에서만 안전합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security scheme %@ offers the OAuth implicit flow, which current OAuth security advice says not to use." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period. The argument is the scheme's name in the file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Sicherheitsschema %@ bietet den OAuth Implicit Flow an, von dem aktuelle OAuth-Sicherheitsempfehlungen abraten."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le schéma de sécurité %@ propose le flux implicite OAuth, que les recommandations de sécurité OAuth actuelles déconseillent."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "セキュリティスキーム%@はOAuthのインプリシットフローを提供しています。現在のOAuthセキュリティのガイダンスでは使わないよう勧められています。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "보안 스킴 %@이(가) OAuth 암시적 흐름을 제공합니다. 현재 OAuth 보안 권고에서는 이를 사용하지 말라고 합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security scheme %@ puts the API key in the URL query, where server logs and browser history keep it." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period. The argument is the scheme's name in the file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Sicherheitsschema %@ setzt den API-Schlüssel in die URL-Abfrage, wo Serverprotokolle und Browserverlauf ihn speichern."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le schéma de sécurité %@ place la clé d’API dans la requête de l’URL, où les journaux du serveur et l’historique du navigateur la conservent."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "セキュリティスキーム%@はAPIキーをURLのクエリに入れています。そこではサーバのログやブラウザの履歴にキーが残ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "보안 스킴 %@이(가) API 키를 URL 쿼리에 넣습니다. 그러면 서버 로그와 브라우저 기록에 키가 남습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Security schemes are defined but no operation requires one, so every operation reads as public." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sicherheitsschemas sind definiert, aber keine Operation verlangt eines, daher gilt jede Operation als öffentlich."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Des schémas de sécurité sont définis, mais aucune opération n’en exige : chaque opération apparaît donc comme publique."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "セキュリティスキームは定義されていますが、どのオペレーションも要求していないため、すべてのオペレーションが公開扱いになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "보안 스킴이 정의되어 있지만 이를 요구하는 오퍼레이션이 없어, 모든 오퍼레이션이 공개로 간주됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends and receives multicast and broadcast traffic on the local network." : {
