          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’équipe de développement qui a signé l’app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリに署名した開発チームです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱에 서명한 개발자 팀입니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file ends inside a string or comment, so its end may be missing." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Datei endet innerhalb eines Strings oder Kommentars, daher fehlt möglicherweise ihr Ende."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le fichier se termine au milieu d’une chaîne ou d’un commentaire : sa fin manque peut-être."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルが文字列またはコメントの途中で終わっているため、末尾が欠けている可能性があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "파일이 문자열이나 주석 중간에서 끝나서 끝부분이 빠졌을 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has a syntax error (%@); what is shown was read before it." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period. The argument is the parser's line and reason.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Datei hat einen Syntaxfehler (%@); angezeigt wird, was davor gelesen wurde."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le fichier contient une erreur de syntaxe (%@) ; ce qui est affiché a été lu avant elle."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルに構文エラーがあります（%@）。表示されているのはその前までに読み込んだ内容です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "파일에 구문 오류가 있습니다(%@). 표시된 내용은 그 앞까지 읽은 것입니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file has no syntax line, so protoc reads it as proto2." : {
      "comment" : "A warning on the API spec preview card (OpenAPI, GraphQL, Protocol Buffers, JSON Schema, Avro); one or two plain sentences ending with a period. protoc and proto2 are names; keep them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Datei hat keine syntax-Zeile, daher liest protoc sie als proto2."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le fichier n’a pas de ligne syntax : protoc le lit donc comme du proto2."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルにsyntax行がないため、protocはproto2として読み込みます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "파일에 syntax 줄이 없어 protoc가 proto2로 읽습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The final stage runs as root (USER %@)." : {
      "comment" : "Infra card warning on a Dockerfile; USER is a Dockerfile instruction, kept as written; the argument is the user as written (root or 0).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die letzte Stufe läuft als root (USER %@)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La dernière étape s’exécute en tant que root (USER %@)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最終ステージはrootとして実行されます（USER %@）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "마지막 스테이지가 root로 실행됩니다(USER %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The final stage sets no USER, so the container runs as root." : {
      "comment" : "Infra card warning on a Dockerfile; USER is a Dockerfile instruction, kept as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
